{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If nothing unusual is found, go upstairs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If something unusual is found, go downstairs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>There are no anomalies on floor 0.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take a good look around and remember what a normal floor looks like.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you correctly identify a floor with no anomalies and go upstairs, you'll advance to the next floor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you make a mistake, you'll be sent back to <strong>Floor 0</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reach <strong>Floor 12</strong> to complete the exam.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are 6 anomalies in total.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848150/extras/9c42927f2e5679af112c4e1c2325cea7.avif?t=1754719840\" data-has-big width=800 height=226 /></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"exam passed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3848150/1d2304d20c06d32cad5083e15d39480926281ce6.jpg"},{"name":"the end","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3848150/aa6792cf0b664104fa7edca5dc29001cb91b9962.jpg"}],"total":2},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3848150?t=1754719840","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3848150?t=1754719840","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848150/a675463b78c68e6d59faa28c6a70e58eafec6c42/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754719840","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848150/a675463b78c68e6d59faa28c6a70e58eafec6c42/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754719840","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"descriptio